<report>
<title>Gini coefficient of inequality</title>
<block name="data">
<br />
<subtitle>Analysis for <in>ti</in>:</subtitle>

<p>Positive non-zero observations = <in>n</in>  <warn><in>msg</in></warn><br />
Variance coefficient = <inu>cv</inu></p>

<p>Re-samples = <in>boots</in><br />
Bias = <inu>bias</inu><br />
Standard error (bootstrap) = <inu>se</inu></p>

<p>Gini coefficient = <inu>gini</inu><br />
<ci>Percentile <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci><br />
<ci>BCa <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>BCafrom</inu> to <inu>BCato</inu></ci></p>

<p>Unbiased estimator of population Gini coefficient = <inu>gini-unbiased</inu><br />
<ci>Percentile <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from-unbiased</inu> to <inu>to-unbiased</inu></ci><br />
<ci>BCa <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>BCafrom-unbiased</inu> to <inu>BCato-unbiased</inu></ci></p>
</block>

<p><in>chart</in></p>
</report>
